@MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5024

### 1. OpenAPI v1 Document
GET {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json
Accept: application/json

### 2. Admin Sign-In (Sets HttpOnly Cookies + Returns AccessToken)
# @name adminLogin
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/auth/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "UsernameOrEmail": "superadmin",
  "Password": "Admin@123"
}

###
@admin_token = {{adminLogin.response.body.Data.AccessToken}}

### 3. Get Current Admin Profile (/Me)
GET {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/auth/Me
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### 4. Refresh Admin Session (Uses admin_refresh_token HttpOnly Cookie + 30s Grace Period)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/auth/Refresh
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### 5. Update Current Admin Profile
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/auth/UpdateProfile
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Username": "superadmin",
  "Email": "admin@ledition.com"
}

### 6. List Submitted Request Articles (Excludes Author Drafts)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/requestarticle/List
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Page": 1,
  "PageSize": 20,
  "SearchKeyword": null,
  "ArticleCategoryId": null,
  "AuthorId": null,
  "Status": null
}

### 7. Get Request Article Detail (With Staged Gallery Photos)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/requestarticle/Detail
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000001"
}

### 8. Review Request Article (Approve -> Auto-Publishes to Tbl_Article)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/requestarticle/Review
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "RequestArticleId": "01JREQ00000000000000000001",
  "Status": "Approved",
  "AdminNotes": "Approved for publication.",
  "IsFeatured": true,
  "IsSpotlight": false
}

### 9. List Published Articles (Tbl_Article)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/article/List
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "Page": 1,
  "PageSize": 20,
  "SearchKeyword": null,
  "ArticleCategoryId": null,
  "AuthorId": null,
  "Status": "Published",
  "IsFeatured": null,
  "IsSpotlight": null
}

### 10. Admin Logout (Clears RefreshTokenHash & PreviousRefreshTokenHash + Deletes HttpOnly Cookies)
POST {{MagizineAdmin.Api_HostAddress}}/api/admin/auth/Logout
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}
